WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
- It is great that you're
doing iCarly again.

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.024
Did you think you would ever
do this again, like a reboot?

00:00:04.024 --> 00:00:04.857
(audience cheering)
- I didn't.

00:00:04.857 --> 00:00:05.690
- Yeah.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.620
It's such a popular show.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.000
- Yeah, it's been so much fun.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.710
We just finished the third season

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.290
and there's this whole love story

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.550
that's been going on on the show

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.620
since I was 13 when I first started it

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:20.400
between my character Carly and
my friend Freddy on the show.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.400
This whole season is all about our love.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.233
- I love that.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.350
- It's been a fun season.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.700
- What a cool thing with a cast

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.370
to know since you were
a kid and growing up,

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.203
that's kind of cool.

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:32.490
- Yeah, we really grew up
together so it's crazy.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.700
Nathan who plays Freddie on
the show has two daughters now

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.170
and is married and it's just crazy.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.070
- So different.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.690
- Being with someone your whole life,

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:40.950
hanging out with someone like that.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.000
It's really nice.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.130
- Well the original show
was for tweens and teens,

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.627
but do you ever get parents saying,

00:00:46.627 --> 00:00:47.790
"Oh my God, I love your show?"

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:48.660
Because as a parent

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.640
I've actually watched this
show with kiddos before

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.400
and it's kind of cool when you make a show

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.080
that parents can sit there with their kids

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.850
and watch and you like it as well.

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:58.980
You're not like, "Oh this again."

00:00:58.980 --> 00:00:59.813
That's kind of cool.

00:00:59.813 --> 00:01:00.900
Do you ever hear from
parents in that sense?

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.430
- Yeah, sometimes parents
will come up to me

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:05.790
and it's really nice
'cause now that the show is

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.730
for the original viewers
and they've all grown up

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.387
a lot of people will
come up to me and say,

00:01:10.387 --> 00:01:12.810
"I'm 30 now and I've been
watching it with my dad again."

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.580
Or, "I've been watching
it with my mom again."

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.020
And that feels really good.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.430
It's something they did
when they were young

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.840
and now they can do it again with them.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.670
- [Kelly] Yeah, you're
helping people connect.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:21.503
That's cool.

00:01:21.503 --> 00:01:22.943
- [Miranda] It's really nice.
- Yeah.

